                <note rend="inline" type="source">890G.00/558: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Iraq</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Knabenshue</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Baghdad</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-04-10T19:00:00+03:00">April 10, 1941—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 11—9 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>73. Iraqi Parliament today voted dismissal of Abdullah [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Abdul Ilah</hi>] from the Regency and elected Al-Sharif Sharaf as Regent.
                    Latter is member of Hashimite family and acted as Regent during brief absence of
                    Faisal in 1925.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knabenshue</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
